       "text": "The order is entered as ORD-0001: metformin 1700 mg by mouth, three times daily with meals.\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the total daily dose of 5,100 mg is above the usual maximum and that you confirmed it as intentional, on the specialist's recommendation, with the rationale documented in the chart.\n\nAt this dose, the team may want to monitor renal function, watch for GI intolerance, and check for signs of lactic acidosis."
